            "review_title": "Review at Cuc Than Bistro",
            "review_text": "Cicciobello\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nHidden fabulous restaurant.\nJun 2020\n- Hey guys, I’ve just found this group for reviewing food and I hope my post could help you adding options to your “Foodies list” ❤️\n - Cuc Than Bistro is located in 306 Nguyen Thuong Hien, 5th ward, District Phu Nhuan.\n - (306 Nguyễn Thượng Hiền, phường 5, Quận Phú Nhuận).\n - I found this place quite quiet and peaceful especially in the evening and at night. \n - They have the greens, pasta, pizzas, seafood dishes, meats and even the whole Beef Wellington (BW) of Gordon Ramsey you must have seen or heard about it once. \n - Words for the BW here, the Puff Pastry was crispy baked, the beef inside was a bit dry but we could still feel the juice of that Medium rare beef. Three kinds of sauce came up with this dish: Spicy sauce, Mustard sauce and Chimichuri (I hope I wrote this name right). And I loved the spicy ones.\n - Me and my friends were in the balcony, ordered the BW, a Mozzarella Salad, one Pan-seared Salmon with Lemon butter sauce and some bottled beers. Sitting in edge of the balcony feeling the peace of this street at night here, I would say that was awesome.\n - For the prizes:\n • 100.000VND / Mozzarella Salad.\n • 209.000VND / Pan-seared Salmon.\n • 390.000VND / Whole Beef Wellington.\n • 25.000 VND / Bottled Tiger beer.\n - Four guys with a 799.000VND bill.\n - So that was my feeling about this warm home bistro, I will be back with some more new places for you guys, have a good day.\n(Please don’t judge my photography skill 😂😂😂)\nRead more\nWritten June 12, 2020",
